(text "Miata ECU motherboard 1989-1995 (NA6 / NA8). Carries the year-specific harness header and the year-independent I/O (wideband, MAP, IAT, USB-C). All engine control is on the daughterboard." (at 30.48 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 60873a31-67f0-456f-ac7a-b3e9585037b9)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))